DTSTAMP:20261109T000000Z
DTSTART:20261110T154500
DTEND:20261110T162000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY
SUMMARY:Astro: skill sequences
DESCRIPTION:Solo: just balls and cones. Bring 3+ balls and 4–6 cones. Abou
 t 75% pace: half speed first\, then full speed.\n• Warm-up: jog\, dynamic
  stretches\, 3 build-ups — 8 min\n• Back to goal\, roll the ball past you
 r side\, open up and take it on the half-turn\, drive past a cone\, shoot
  — 4 × 5 reps\n• Weak foot: throw the ball up and control it with your we
 ak foot (or thigh or chest first)\, then weak-foot finishes — 10 min
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Astro: skill sequences
TRIGGER:-PT10M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
