DTSTAMP:20261109T000000Z
DTSTART:20261113T154500
DTEND:20261113T163000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY
SUMMARY:Astro: speed + match reps
DESCRIPTION:Solo. Bring 3+ balls and 6 cones so you’re not chasing balls. 
 Full recovery between sprints\; stop after 2 slow reps.\n• Warm-up: A-ski
 ps\, strides — 10 min\n• Plyometrics: broad jumps (max effort\, stick the
  landing) — 3 × 3\n• Plyometrics: single-leg bounds — 2 × 4 each leg\n• 1
 0m sprints — 3 × 1\n• 20m sprints — 2 × 1\n• Runs in behind: knock the ba
 ll past a cone into space\, sprint onto it\, one touch\, shoot — 6–8 reps
 \n• Near-post darts: set the ball out wide\, dart to the near post\, fini
 sh first time — 6–8 reps\, half weak foot\n• 1v1 into shot: run at a cone
  “defender” at speed\, do a move\, burst past\, shoot — 6–8 reps\n• Finis
 hing from self-set balls\, at least half weak foot — 10 min\n• Skill snac
 k: handstand kick-ups — 10 min
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Astro: speed + match reps
TRIGGER:-PT10M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
